{id="t0073-01",kind="set",pieces={"Pistol","Bread"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="furniture",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="A place at the table",body="The food bundle is tied to a route note for new arrivals; the last line says the group left before the next watch could bring the promised supplies.",anchor={map="MarchRidgeStashMap9",mark=1}},
